      "mechanism": "Order-size decomposition separates informed large-ticket flow from retail small-ticket flow; large-order net inflow should predict positive and retail small-order net inflow negative short-horizon returns. Flows are normalized by same-window amount to be cross-sectionally comparable; moneyflow is after-close and used with a T+1 lag.",
